removes: a removed loop reports on the key whatever job holds it, so a run that makes a unit durable as it stops sets the latest success of the job ensured in its place
packages: ./worker/internal/schedule
tests: TestARemovedLoopReportsNothingOnTheJobEnsuredInItsPlace
scheduled-count: no

